  "thinking": "The operations lead says the 600 GPUs were resold but gave no buyer, transfer date, or reference. F3 drew roughly 10 MWh per day above baseline on days 12–21. Check the last day of that plateau for a periodic signal consistent with day 16. A recurring signal would support a sustained workload while leaving periodic cooling and batch inference possible.",
